*5 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 28.67~38.67 seconds<sup>860f~1,160f</sup>.
*20 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
*20 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~14 seconds<sup>60f~420f</sup>.
*20 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 6~16 seconds<sup>180f~480f</sup>.
