**1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**3 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
**10 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 22~32 seconds<sup>660f~960f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~14 seconds<sup>60f~420f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 6~16 seconds<sup>180f~480f</sup>.
**7 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~22 seconds<sup>600f~660f</sup>.
